==English==

===Etymology===
From the expression ''the [[early bird catches the worm]]''.

===Noun===
'''[[early]] [[bird]]'''

# {{idiom}} A [[person]] who [[wake]]s [[early]] or [[arrive]]s early, typically before most others.

